# Bot1's Feline Sovereign, Grizzly Bears (not a Cat) and Sacred Cat (a Cat with protection from Dogs, CR 702.16f) attack on turn 3;
# Bot2 has a Long-Bodied Grey Dog, its own Sacred Cat, a Mox Jet and a Treasure token. The Dog may not block Sacred Cat, but may
# block Feline Sovereign (not "other", so no protection); Bot2's Cat blocks Sacred Cat. No Cat of Bot1's deals combat damage to a
# player: Sovereign and Sacred Cat damage creatures only, and the unblocked Grizzly Bears is no Cat. So the trigger never
# goes on the stack (no target is asked), and Bot2 keeps every artifact.
